### Create a payment-success event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "PAYMENT_SUCCESS",
  "userId": "user-1",
  "referenceId": "payment-1001"
}

### Read an event (replace UUID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Read latest notifications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notifications/users/user-1?limit=20

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
